Style w:val="Heading1"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>2. About KE Aqua Group</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>KE Aqua Group is an integrated aquaculture platform based in Krishna District, Andhra Pradesh, bringing together practical commercial aquaculture farming, aquaculture inputs, laboratory support, scientific farm monitoring, technology adoption, practical aquaculture learning and seafood value addition.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Through Kamatham Enterprises, Aqua Pulse Trader’s, KE Aqua Farms and KE Coastal, the group aims to connect different stages of the aquaculture value chain under one practical, science-driven and responsible approach.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/></w:rPr><w:t>Vision:</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve"> To build an integrated aquaculture ecosystem connecting farming, science, technology, farmer development and seafood value addition.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/></w:rPr><w:t>Mission:</w:t></w:r><w:r><w:t xml:space="preserve"> To practice aquaculture under real commercial conditions, learn continuously from farm data and challenges, adopt suitable science and technology, and share practical knowledge with farmers and aspiring aquaculture entrepreneurs.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading1"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>3. Business Divisions</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>3.1 Kamatham Enterprises</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:tbl><w:tblPr><w:tblStyle w:val="TableGrid"/><w:tblW w:type="auto" w:w="0"/><w:jc w:val="center"/><w:tblLook w:firstColumn="1" w:firstRow="1" w:lastColumn="0" w:lastRow="0" w:noHBand="0" w:noVBand="1" w:val="04A0"/></w:tblPr><w:tblGrid><w:gridCol w:w="5112"/><w:gridCol w:w="5112"/></w:tblGrid><w:tr><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:type="dxa" w:w="5112"/><w:vAlign w:val="center"/></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:rPr><w:b/></w:rPr><w:t>Tagline</w:t></w:r></w:p></w:tc><w:tc><w:tcPr><w:tcW w:type="dxa" w:w="5112"/><w:vAlign w:val="center"/></w:tcPr><w:p><w:r><w:t>From Feed to Healt